// ---------------------------------------------------------------------
// RS_Grenade -- hold to charge, release to throw.
//
// BT_USER4 is the button the weapon code reads (RS_GrenadeThrower reads
// it out of original_cmd in PlayerThink, so it is seen before the weapon
// thinks and cannot fight your gun). Bound to G by default; your
// deployed weapon is never put away.
// ---------------------------------------------------------------------
addmenukey "Throw Grenade (hold to charge)" +user4
defaultbind G +user4

// ---------------------------------------------------------------------
// RS_Hook -- the grappling hook. Always available, not a pickup.
//
// BT_USER1, read out of original_cmd in PlayerThink (RS_HookThrower),
// same as the grenade and for the same reason: PlayerThink runs before
// the weapon thinks, so the read cannot fight your gun.
//
// H is unbound in both defbinds.txt and commonbinds.txt, so this bind
// actually takes -- see the MOUSE3 note above for what happens when it
// does not.
// ---------------------------------------------------------------------
addmenukey "Fire Grappling Hook" +user1
defaultbind H +user1

